>> title: Chocolate Chip Cookie Bars
>> category: Bars & Brownies
>> tags: chocolate chip, cookie, dessert, oven
>> servings: 12
>> time: 50 min
>> step.7: press into the pan and bake at 350°F for 25 min

Preheat the #oven{} to 350°F (175°C).

Line a #9x9-in pan{} with parchment.

Beat @melted unsalted butter{3/4%cup}(170 g) with @light brown sugar{3/4%cup}(150 g), @granulated sugar{1/4%cup}(50 g).

Whisk @&(~1)butter mixture{} with @egg{1%large}(50 g), @egg yolk{1%large}(20 g), and @vanilla extract{2%tsp}(10 mL).

Fold @all-purpose flour{1 3/4%cup}(230 g), @baking soda{1/2%tsp}(2.5 g), @table salt{3/4%tsp}(4.5 g) into @&(~1)batter{}.

Stir @semisweet chocolate chips{1 1/2%cup}(255 g) into @&(~1)dough{}.

Press @&(~1)cookie dough{} into the pan and bake at 350°F for ~{25%min}.
